WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:06.006
Things can sometimes move slowly here on earth.

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:08.800
More often, though, they move quickly.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.177
So use your time well.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.222
Because time is precious.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:24.899
Though we have come a long way, there is plenty left for you to do.

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:28.445
You will figure lots of things out for yourself.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:32.032
Just remember to leave notes for everybody else.

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.491
Well...

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:35.827
That is planet Earth.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:40.331
Make sure you look after it, as it's all we've got. 

00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:49.382
That was epic.

